        "display_unit": "function_symmetry_rewrite",
        "explanation": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\because\\ f(x)=g(x)+1\\\\\\therefore\\ g(x)=f(x)-1\\\\\\therefore\\ g(-x)=f(-x)-1\\\\\\because\\ g\\text{ 是奇函数}\\\\\\therefore\\ g(-x)=f(-x)-1=-g(x)\\\\\\therefore\\ f(-x)-1=-\\left(f(x)-1\\right)\\\\\\therefore\\ f(-x)-1=-f(x)+1\\\\\\therefore\\ f(x)+f(-x)=2\\end{gathered}$$",
